    note: "Head of the interior-redesign chain — this merge unblocks 11 cards. Build gate needed 2 fix attempts: attempt 1 died on a migration-head assertion doing its job (015 made '014 is the only head' false) and on a phantom 48-skip regression that did not exist. Review found one Important, caused by the orchestrator's own same-day ADR-0037/R2 amendment landing under the card. Two Minors routed out rather than absorbed: F-005 to CARD-225 (FLOOR_MM's lower pin is a 0.22 mm straddle, and the missing pin IS AC-370, already declared owed to that card), O-1 to CARD-227 (stale registry test: pointers, not missing coverage)."
